# Vaultwarden folder: homelab
# Format: source_folder|source_item|source_field|target_env
# Render these to a local .env file before deploy; never commit rendered values.
#
# Persistent Diary/Goals store on the shared critical Postgres service:
homelab|personal-dashboard/database|database_url|PERSONAL_DASHBOARD_DATABASE_URL
#
# No committed secret values are required for the MVP default reverse-proxy-auth deployment.
# Non-secret live-render inputs can be copied from .env.example.
#
# If Ben later chooses app-level shared-password auth, create items such as:
# homelab|personal-dashboard/auth|shared-password|DASHBOARD_SHARED_PASSWORD
# homelab|personal-dashboard/auth|session-secret|DASHBOARD_SESSION_SECRET
#
# If Cloudflare public-hostname/DNS changes are automated instead of done in the
# Zero Trust dashboard, use this existing/expected API item and keep values local:
# homelab|cloudflare/api|api_token|CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN
# homelab|cloudflare/api|zone_id|CLOUDFLARE_ZONE_ID
# homelab|cloudflare/api|account_id|CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID
